# ALLOWLIST for the devcontainer build context (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root .dockerignore).
#
# Everything is excluded, then exactly what the integration suite compiles is
# re-admitted: the module files, the root package's and providertest's
# non-test sources, and the integration suite itself. The image therefore
# cannot carry .git, local.mk, a stray credentials file, the repository-local
# tool cache (bin/) or a coverage profile — whatever lands in the checkout
# tomorrow, it is excluded until someone admits it here on purpose.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!providertest/*.go
!test/integration/**/*.go
!build/docker/devcontainer/run-integration-tests.sh
# The root package's and providertest's own unit tests are not part of this
# suite and are not compiled by it.
*_test.go
providertest/*_test.go
!test/integration/**/*_test.go
